        "answer": {
          "short": "$P(x)=(x-1)(x+4)+9$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+3x+5-(x-1)x&=4x+5\\\\4x+5-(x-1)4&=9\\end{align*}$$\nThus $Q(x)=x+4$ and $R(x)=9$.\n$$P(x)=(x-1)(x+4)+9.$$",
